# Architecture

- Stack: FastAPI · SQLAlchemy **2.x** · Alembic · **PostgreSQL only** (SoT) · React+TS · Python workers
- No architecture drift (no alternate SoT, ORM, or queue-as-orchestration-SoT without accepted ADR)
- Prefer improving existing patterns over new technologies
- Simple, maintainable, modular, production-ready
- Backward compatibility unless an approved migration plan exists
- Document significant architectural and release-impacting decisions in `docs/`
